<BaseLayout title="About the Presentation — Kalma Concepts" description="Scope, illustrative content, asset attribution and privacy details for this independent Café Kalma website concept."><main id="main" class="notice-page" tabindex="-1"><Wordmark href="/" /><h1>A creative exploration.<br /><em>An independent concept.</em></h1><p>{business.notice} This presentation was created to explore a possible digital direction. It is not an official business website, shop or customer service channel.</p><h2>Facts and creative interpretation</h2><p>The name, Guatemalan coffee identity, “A moment worth tasting” headline and Seelingstraße 34 address are referenced from <a href={business.website}>Kalma’s publicly visible website</a>, checked on 30 October 2026. The website describes a first home in Berlin in preparation; no opening date or hours are asserted here.</p><p>All menu examples, atmosphere photographs and supporting concept copy are illustrative. Photography does not depict confirmed Kalma products, suppliers, farms or premises. The typographic wordmark is a temporary design treatment, not an official logo. “Organic” names a creative direction; it does not claim organic certification for any product.</p><h2>Image and font credits</h2><p>Illustrative photographs are sourced from <a href="https://unsplash.com/license">Unsplash</a> and stored locally. Exact photo identifiers and source URLs are recorded in the repository’s <code>docs/ASSETS.md</code>. Cormorant Garamond, DM Sans and Fraunces are distributed under the SIL Open Font License; license files are included with the locally hosted fonts.</p><h2 id="privacy">Privacy & demonstration details</h2><p>The newsletter input and button are disabled. There is no subscription service, ordering, payment processing, analytics, tracking cookie or visitor-data storage implemented by this site. All images and fonts load locally. Hosting infrastructure may maintain technical request logs according to the hosting provider’s policies.</p><p>Google Maps and Instagram links take you to external services only when you choose to follow them. Their privacy policies then apply.</p><h2 id="legal">Legal notice — placeholder</h2><p>This is a presentation placeholder, not a completed legal notice for a live commercial website. Operator details and the appropriate legal documents must be supplied and reviewed before any public business launch. Café Kalma’s company information has not been reused as this independent concept’s operator identity.</p><a class="text-link" href="/">Back to the concepts <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></main></BaseLayout>
